<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FPSBD Katering Management</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .dashboard-card {
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .dashboard-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) !important;
        }

        .icon-box {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-dark bg-dark shadow-sm mb-5">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="navbar-brand mb-0 h1">
                <i class="bi bi-egg-fried me-2 text-warning"></i> FPSBD Katering Management
            </span>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="p-4 p-md-5 mb-4 rounded text-body-emphasis bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <div class="col-lg-8 px-0">
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-dark">Sistem Manajemen Katering</h1>
                <p class="lead my-3 text-muted">Selamat datang di sistem informasi manajemen Katering. Pakai Menu dibawah ini untuk mengelola caterign 😇😇.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center p-3 dashboard-card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="icon-box bg-primary bg-gradient text-white">
                            <i class="bi bi-people-fill fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Karyawan</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Kelola data karyawan Katering.</p>
                        <a href="/karyawan" class="btn btn-primary w-100 mt-2">Buka Data</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center p-3 dashboard-card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="icon-box bg-success bg-gradient text-white">
                            <i class="bi bi-journal-text fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Menu Kuliner</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Data menu makanan  untuk melakukanpemesanan.</p>
                        <a href="/menu" class="btn btn-success w-100 mt-2">Buka Data</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center p-3 dashboard-card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="icon-box bg-warning bg-gradient text-dark">
                            <i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Pemesan</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Kelola data pelanggan tetap nomor kontak dan email.</p>
                        <a href="/pemesan" class="btn btn-warning w-100 text-dark fw-bold mt-2">Buka Data</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div
                    class="card h-100 shadow text-center p-3 dashboard-card border border-danger-subtle bg-danger-subtle bg-opacity-10">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="icon-box bg-danger bg-gradient text-white shadow-sm">
                            <i class="bi bi-cart-plus-fill fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-danger">Lakukan Pesanan</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Buat pemesanan baru untuk pelanggan.</p>
                        <a href="/pesanan/create" class="btn btn-danger w-100 mt-2 fw-bold shadow-sm">Mulai
                            Transaksi</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm text-center p-3 dashboard-card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="icon-box bg-info bg-gradient text-white">
                            <i class="bi bi-clipboard2-data-fill fs-3"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Log Pemesanan</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Riwayat transaksi, status pengiriman & pembayaran.</p>
                        <a href="/logPemesanan" class="btn btn-info w-100 mt-2 fw-bold text-white">Lihat Log</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>

</html>